# SEO & marketing copy

## Two copy layers

| Layer | Surfaces | Bitcoin / chain jargon |
|-------|----------|------------------------|
| Diegetic | Hero, teasers, WhatIs, how-it-works, extraction-survival body, item-economy body, gameplay FAQ | Forbidden — Record, rift, breach, Hold, vault |
| Acquisition | `metaTitle` / `metaDescription`, `/bitcoin-rifts/`, explicit Bitcoin FAQ Qs, crypto audience card, JSON-LD where needed | Allowed — explain build + SEO |

Do not mix layers on one surface without intent. Diegetic answers that need tech detail point to `/bitcoin-rifts/`.

## Per-page checklist

- Unique `title` + `description` via `PageMeta`
- Canonical via `pageUrl(path)`
- OG image path registered (`og-images.ts` + `generate-og.mjs`)
- JSON-LD: homepage Organization/WebSite/VideoGame; FAQ → FAQPage; content → WebPage + BreadcrumbList
- Sitemap priority in `astro.config.mjs` for new indexable URLs
- Internal links use trailing-slash `pagePath()`

## Content sources

- Landing chrome: `src/data/copy.ts`
- SEO spokes: `src/data/seo-pages.ts` + thin `src/pages/<slug>.astro` wrapping `ContentPage`
- FAQ: `src/data/faq.ts`

